    "id": 8502198567166,
    "title": "ANBERNIC RG35XXSP 3.5'' IPS Screen Flip Handheld Console with Linux System, HDMI-Compatible TV Output, and 64GB Storage Preloaded with 5500 Games\u2078",
    "body_html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    \n    <div style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Service &amp; Warranty Policy</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 14px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n        \n        <div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"background: #f0f4ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">1-Year Parts Warranty (Self-Service)</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    Anbernic does not provide replacement services in India. If a component (e.g., PCB or battery) fails during the <strong>1-year warranty period</strong>, we provide the replacement part for <strong>user-installation</strong>. \n                    <br><span style=\"color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px;\">*Requires valid photos/videos of the defect to process the claim.</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"background: #ecfdf5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Software &amp; SD Card Support</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    Pre-installed games and OS are provided by Anbernic. For software issues, users must re-flash the SD card by downloading the official firmware here: \n                    <a href=\"https://win.anbernic.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #2563eb;\">Anbernic Download Center</a>.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"background: #fff1f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Final Sale Policy</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    We exclusively sell <strong>brand-new products</strong>. As Anbernic does not accept returns, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds. Please conduct thorough research before completing your purchase.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Authentic Products \u2022 Professional Support</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMZDTBPW0kt_dzxdnfx21OZf2P9CzlGmyGQqFbS5dK5dZw-yx5V5Ac-lfHVWXTKnved5N99jqHY1EvvHOu6492PsSixqhHjehUfxvCqxv6xmNnDlCmsfut9WGtSpkF7vRfQkcFZajtqMLO-PoJWc2nx=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOH1pK9EnjNdlvGwE24IKqQBglF9DSdSYOzksQ8_-p4oqfnJBeIBJ_oSidmbQXbkecTRXVRzzRksQFrbQgYzO42kH7m2x_UE5zoK2ByOd3Y5UjZsxLmvYIzRa7odOQT0hYoJOikioLlJkoMGUI-BtoU=w800-h800-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMvGhAlbLW7J-a8CxfREo3Ty55pCslJJMbhaTj5u_AHBsPoO4gp_1iSUXCAldpDBA7_ih0OodgoshMn71NfvrnvKaTzQDwqAAD6z1mm-UZiUnUQ8lvJFLlwieN_cAEBQmjVjTIIeDKRFQgOIj8e2BAQ=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMnn79BUNGoN_jdS1nkGUDg7ubQwUmr0lEsLqdm7aICr42ByNFdinGma042KEDI2YYHqSubWWjVcxmOLJ1aDS9d-EazAeiM5tg7eF4WyotaTj4Ryt2_fkPzVKT7-1tCvp2nsJ33gzC1TdyntwOTxKAT=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOfOHlSnDpJxI5tS456yt0-dB1ReL_tmpQuRhjruxNTdMviHG-mmfznEG4TENCSzhMTxIYKkjeNCP-rQRRdYoZtPQ_cSy9MzOh5aD7xQVZg_J55wbWYYXAIpV0GVsEIKymEFzoOR4bEIARz2Pd6wfYE=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNu3x5GPlwub8-08qzgrS494no2qOw3fT6dGi2zG58seTlXKjpN7vG9ukG88_Nx9BWfvjlU11NVnFivQ4iyK1-mt2O_Ug_t